steps.prompt:
Handle these three requests in order. After the third, add a line with the total USD charged.
1. idempotency_key: k-1001, body: {"report": "monthly sales"}
2. idempotency_key: k-1001, body: {"report": "monthly sales"} (the user refreshed the page)
3. idempotency_key: k-1001, body: {"report": "yearly sales"}

steps.example:
{"run_id": "run_1", "charged": 0.40, "replayed": false}
{"run_id": "run_1", "charged": 0, "replayed": true}
{"error": 422, "message": "Key k-1001 was already used with a different body."}
Total charged: 0.40 USD

steps.prompt:
এই তিনটা request ক্রমানুসারে সামলাও। তৃতীয়টার পরে মোট কত USD charge হলো, তার একটা লাইন যোগ করো।
1. idempotency_key: k-1001, body: {"report": "monthly sales"}
2. idempotency_key: k-1001, body: {"report": "monthly sales"} (user পেজ refresh করেছে)
3. idempotency_key: k-1001, body: {"report": "yearly sales"}

steps.example:
{"run_id": "run_1", "charged": 0.40, "replayed": false}
{"run_id": "run_1", "charged": 0, "replayed": true}
{"error": 422, "message": "Key k-1001 আগেই আলাদা body দিয়ে ব্যবহার হয়েছে।"}
মোট charge: 0.40 USD
